-- =============================================================================
-- OpenCase test data — 200 document templates for oc_opencase_templates
-- =============================================================================
-- Inserts 200 rows with random realistic Danish template names for local /
-- staging testing (pagination, search, sorting, etc. on the templates list).
--
-- storage_filename has a UNIQUE index (oc_tmpl_storage_filename), so each row
-- gets a numbered suffix on the same base filename rather than reusing the
-- literal value verbatim (all 200 rows still point at the same physical demo
-- file content — only the DB filename column differs).
--
-- Usage:
--   docker exec -i master-database-mysql-1 mysql -u nextcloud -pnextcloud nextcloud \
--     < apps-extra/opencase/scripts/insert_test_templates.sql
--
-- Compatible with MySQL 5.7+ and MariaDB 10.1+.
-- =============================================================================

